message: "If you use this software, cite this version and the relevant manuscript listed in papers/CITATION.bib."
title: "Legitimacy: A Machine-Checked Kernel for the Governance Layer of AI Agents"
abstract: >-
  A research artifact for compiling agentic AI governance rules into semantic
  legitimacy kernels, with machine-checked impossibility theorems and
  capability-scaling bounds in Lean 4 and an executable audit layer in Rust.
